From: Jia Qingtong <jiaqingtong@huawei.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Jun 2025 15:24:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 588/960] downstream: arm64: cpufeature: Fix compilation error
 of NMI

Fix compilation error of NMI.

Signed-off-by: Jia Qingtong <jiaqingtong@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: chenyi <chenyi211@h-partners.com>
Signed-off-by: Liu Shixin <liushixin2@huawei.com>
---
 arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c b/arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c
index 0cc324cf3584..4ba50ff40f6e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c
+++ b/arch/arm64/kernel/cpufeature.c
@@ -2924,7 +2924,7 @@ static const struct arm64_cpu_capabilities arm64_features[] = {
 #ifdef CONFIG_ARM64_NMI
 		.cpu_enable = nmi_enable,
 #endif
-	};
+	},
 #ifdef CONFIG_ARM64_TWED
 	{
 		.desc = "Delayed Trapping of WFE",
